<div class="p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 text-center">
  <!-- Success Icon & Title -->
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-sm ring-8 ring-emerald-50/50">
      <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Agendamento Realizado!</h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-md mx-auto">
      Seu horário foi reservado com sucesso no <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800"><%= @booking_tenant.name %></span>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Appointment Details Ticket Card -->
  <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 p-5 sm:p-6 text-left space-y-4 shadow-sm">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-200">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Comprovante de Reserva</span>
      <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200">
        <%= @appointment.status.humanize %>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Cliente</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5"><%= @appointment.client&.name %></p>
        <p class="text-slate-500"><%= @appointment.client&.phone %></p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Serviço</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5"><%= @appointment.service&.name %></p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium"><%= @appointment.service&.duration_minutes %> min · <%= format_cents(@appointment.price_cents) %></p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Profissional</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5"><%= @appointment.professional&.name %></p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Data e Horário</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-indigo-600 mt-0.5"><%= l(@appointment.starts_at.to_date, format: :long) %></p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-semibold"><%= @appointment.starts_at.strftime("%H:%M") %> às <%= @appointment.ends_at.strftime("%H:%M") %></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if @appointment.notes.present? %>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs">
        <p class="text-slate-400">Suas Observações:</p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 italic mt-0.5">"<%= @appointment.notes %>"</p>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <!-- Friendly Notice -->
  <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50/60 border border-indigo-100 text-xs text-indigo-900 text-left flex items-start gap-3">
    <span class="text-base flex-shrink-0">📌</span>
    <p>Guarde esta confirmação. Caso precise desmarcar ou tirar dúvidas, por favor entre em contato com o estabelecimento com antecedência.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Action -->
  <div class="pt-2">
    <%= link_to "Fazer Novo Agendamento", booking_path(tenant_slug: @booking_tenant.slug), class: "inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl text-xs transition-colors shadow-sm" %>
  </div>
</div>
